@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### Criar evento
POST {{base}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Show de abertura",
  "venue": "Teatro Municipal",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-15T15:00:00"
}

### Listar eventos
GET {{base}}/events

### Criar lote
# Troque o eventId pelo id retornado acima.
POST {{base}}/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/lots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "1º lote",
  "price": 80.00,
  "totalQuantity": 10
}

### Consultar lote
GET {{base}}/lots/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Reservar
# Responde 500 "TODO RN-08" até ReservationService.create existir.
POST {{base}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lotId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "customerEmail": "voce@email.com",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Pagar
POST {{base}}/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/pay

### Cancelar
POST {{base}}/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
